      "summary_en": "From the twin barrels of her Relic Cannon, Senna fires a unified beam of light and shadow through a target, healing allies and damaging enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "赛娜从她的圣物火炮的双生炮管中射出一道光影相生之芒来洞穿一个目标，治疗友军并伤害敌人。",
