      "summary_en": "Senna calls upon the relic stones of fallen Sentinels, splitting her relic cannon into a holy array of shadow and light. She then fires a global beam that shields allies from harm, while damaging enemies caught in the center.",
      "summary_zh": "赛娜召唤陨落哨兵们的圣石，将她的圣物火炮拆分成一座光与影的神圣阵列。她随后会发射一道不限距离的光束，来为命中的友军提供护盾，并对中心区域内的敌人造成伤害。",
